# AI tool output (Ruflo, Agentic QE, AgentDB, RuVector, Codex, Claude Code)
# Private learned stores and one machine's launchers: never commit them. AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md stay tracked.
# Ruflo (claude-flow) runtime state and swarm stores
.claude-flow/
.swarm/
.hive-mind/
# Agentic QE runtime state and learned stores
.agentic-qe/
# AgentDB and RuVector stores
agentdb.rvf*
*.rvf
*.rvf.lock
*.rvf.manifest.json
ruvector.db
# Launchers onboarding points at this machine's installs (D6, D11): per machine, never shared
.mcp.json
.mcp.json.*
.codex/
# Claude Code: local settings and agent worktrees (D19)
**/.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
# Leftover tool locks
.beads.gate.lock
